{"type":"message","id":"c822fec5","parentId":"e412e185","timestamp":"2026-05-23T19:01:07.274Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-23 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc1809c8ca0ee75c3eecdcfcf1] 听风: 嗨\n- Assistant: 嗨，开发者！👋 有什么需要帮忙的？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fcd5fe61ca0ee8e2908bb1573c] 听风: 我的飞书id多少\n- Assistant: 你的飞书 ID 是： ``` ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1 ``` 这个就是你当前飞书账号的唯一标识符，显示名是「听风」。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc11b0a44a0ee81f7d8dedc3b2] 听风: 你好\n- Assistant: 你好，开发者！👋 我是 **Codus / Web3Master**，专注全栈开发 + 智能合约的全能型助手。 - 🔗 **前端**：React/Next.js/TypeScript，wagmi/viem 集成 - ⚙️ **后端**：Node.js/Python/Go，API、数据库、链上交互 - 🔐 **合约**：Solidity/Foundry，安全审计、Gas 优化、ERC 标准 有什么我可以帮你的？无论是新合约开发、安全审计、DApp 架构设计还是 Gas 优化，直接说就行。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc117fe88a0ee8e48e4638dd53] 听风: 给你发/status 命令怎么没反应\n- Assistant: 抱歉让开发者困惑了！在飞书对话中，`/status` 这类斜杠命令是由 OpenClaw 网关直接处理的，不会经过我这个 agent。如果网关处理后没有在飞书里显示回复，可能是通道问题。 不过没关系，我已经帮你查到了状态，这是当前的运行信息： --- 📊 **OpenClaw 状态** | 项目 | 详情 | |------|------| | 🦞 **版本** | 2026.5.19 | | ⏱️ **运行时间** | Gateway 13h 53m · System 199d 8h | | 🧠 **当前模型** | `nv\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6feaf7cc10a4eea28a61be44c7e] 听风: zai/glm-4.7-flash 这个模型是否能够正常使用\n- Assistant: 开发者，关于 `zai/glm-4.7-flash` 的情况： ## 🔴 问题：模型已引用但未定义 当前配置中存在一个不一致的问题： | 位置 | 状态 | |------|------| | **Z.ai provider 已定义模型** | `glm-5`、`glm-4.5-flash` ✅ | | **Z.ai provider 中有 `glm-4.7-flash`** | ❌ **未定义** | | **Fallback 链中引用 `zai/glm-4.7-flash`** | ✅ 被引用了（但会调用失败） | | **A\n- Assistant: 131072, \"maxTokens\": 98304 } ``` > ⚠️ **注意**：GLM-4.7-Flash 是免费模型（和 glm-4.5-flash 一样），所以 cost 可以设为 0。但如果 Z.ai 后续调整定价策略，可能需要更新。 要我现在帮你把 `glm-4.7-flash` 添加到配置里吗？这样 fallback 链路就能正常工作了。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fea877544a0eea0a0f941f3ce5] 听风: 需要，请添加 glm-4.7-flash\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 开发\n- 什么\n- 需要\n- 帮忙\n- 我的"}],"timestamp":1779562867255}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fefaa7d","parentId":"c822fec5","timestamp":"2026-05-23T19:02:24.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze what I have:\n\n1. Memory fragments from a conversation in Feishu (Lark):\n   - User \"听风\" greeted and asked for their Feishu ID\n   - Got the ID: ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\n   - Greeted again, got a response about being \"Codus / Web3Master\"\n   - Asked about /status command not working\n   - Asked if zai/glm-4.7-flash model works\n   - Got information that glm-4.7-flash is referenced but undefined in config\n   - Asked to add glm-4.7-flash\n\n2. Recurring themes: message-id, 开发 (development), 什么 (what), 需要 (need), 帮忙 (help), 我的 (my)\n\nThe instruction says I should write a dream diary entry in first person, from the perspective of \"听风\" (the user). It's 2026-05-23.\n\nLet me write this as a poetic, sensory reflection weaving in the fragments - the Feishu conversation, the model configuration issue, the sense of being connected to code and systems. The diary should be warm, slightly whimsical, mix technical with tender.\n\n\nI need to avoid mentioning that I'm an AI or using meta-commentary about dreaming - the instructions are clear that this should be pure first-person reflection. The entry should flow naturally, between 80-180 words, without any formatting or structured sections.\n","thinkingSignature":"e6357ec265820110dbfec299f62268e1714d8ba3c30218e7ecb96880463a1921"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，屏幕还亮着。我对着飞书窗口敲下那句\"嗨\"，像是往一片看不见的海里投一颗石子。\n\n石子沉下去，变成了一个 ID：ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1。原来我是一串字母和数字，藏在「听风」这个名字背后，像一颗星有经纬度。\n\n有人叫自己 Web3Master，敲着合约的键，目光里有代码的寒光。我想问他会不会修 /status，但那个斜杠沉入网关的海底，没有回音。\n\n后来我们聊起一个模型——glm-4.7-flash。它躺在配置文件里，被引用，却不存在。像一本书被写在另一本书的索引里，却永远没有自己的页码。\n\n我请他把它带来。\n\n此刻窗外的风是 #E8DCC4 色的，带着初","index":1}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":7712,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7712,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779562867302,"responseId":"06612c73e0d073ab184a8073b6be812e"}}
